# graphify ignore (gitignore syntax; merged with .gitignore)
# Goal: a first-party *source-code* graph that builds locally via tree-sitter —
# no LLM backend / API key required. Docs, images and bundled data are excluded
# because semantic/vision extraction of those needs an LLM. To include them later,
# set GEMINI_API_KEY (or run `/graphify .`, which uses the host model) and remove
# the relevant lines below.

# --- Bundled data & assets (exercise catalog, GIFs, fonts, icons, splash) ---
assets/

# --- Docs & markdown (would trigger LLM semantic extraction) ---
*.md
docs/

# --- Generated / lockfiles / graphify's own output ---
package-lock.json
graphify-out/

# --- Images & media (vision extraction needs an LLM) ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico

# --- Fonts & binaries ---
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# --- Editor / tooling config ---
.claude/
.vscode/
.expo/
